<h1 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 20px;" align="center">Greenleaf Park Groundbreaking Ceremony</h1>
<h3 class="gd_p" style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 18px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 17px;" align="center">Thursday, Nov. 5, at 10:30 a.m.<strong>  |</strong>  <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Iglesia+Camino+de+Santidad,+1553+Brown+Rd,+Columbus,+OH+43223/@39.9502758,-83.0565584,13331m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m9!4m8!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x8838857712405625:0x866f297f4072fdc3!2m2!1d-83.0396148!2d39.924703!3e0?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MTAxOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Link for directions to the location" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #00213E;">1553 Brown Road, 43223</a></span>
</h3>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="left"><br>We are excited to invite you to the groundbreaking ceremony for Greenleaf Park on Thursday, Nov. 5, from 10:30-11 a.m. Greenleaf Park is a new 8.9-acre neighborhood park at Brown Road and Greenleaf Road, which is part of a multi-site public investment to expand park space on Columbus' Southwest Side. </p>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="left">Parking will be available at Iglesia Camino de Santidad (1553 Brown Road, Columbus, OH 43223), located right next to the groundbreaking site.</p>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="left">If you’re planning to attend the ceremony, we ask that you RSVP using the button below. We can't wait to see you! </p>
<table class="govd_button" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding-bottom: 15px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; margin: 0 auto;" align="center"><tbody><tr><td class="govd_button" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; background-color: #e31b23; border-radius: 5px; text-align: center; display: inline-block; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; padding: 10px; border: none;" align="center" bgcolor="#e31b23"><a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/01a17898d9a479ce8c94a0439d9b1721?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Link to RSVP" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-decoration: none !important;"><strong style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none;">RSVP TO CEREMONY</strong></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>
